#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:1
msgid "How to migrate from reStructuredText to MyST Markdown"
msgstr "如何从 reStructuredText 迁移到 MyST Markdown"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:3
msgid ""
"In this guide, you will find how you can start writing Markdown in your "
"existing reStructuredText project, or migrate it completely."
msgstr "本指南讲解如何在现有的 reStructuredText 项目中开始编写 Markdown，或完全迁移过去。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Sphinx is usually associated with reStructuredText, the markup language "
"{pep}`designed for the CPython project in the early '00s <287>`. However, "
"for quite some time Sphinx has been compatible with Markdown as well, thanks"
" to a number of extensions."
msgstr ""
"Sphinx 通常与 reStructuredText 联系在一起——这是 {pep}`为 CPython 项目设计的 <287>` 标记语言。不过 "
"thanks to 若干扩展，Sphinx 早已兼容 Markdown。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:12
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The most powerful of such extensions is {doc}`MyST-Parser <myst-"
"parser:index>`, which implements a CommonMark-compliant, extensible Markdown"
" dialect with support for the Sphinx roles and directives that make it so "
"useful."
msgstr ""
"其中最强大的扩展是 {doc}`MyST-Parser <myst-parser:index>`，它实现了一种符合 CommonMark 且可扩展的 "
"Markdown 方言，并支持使其如此有用的 Sphinx 角色和指令。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If, **instead of migrating**, you are starting a new project from scratch, "
"have a look at {doc}`myst-parser:intro`. If you are starting a **project for"
" Jupyter**, you can start with Jupyter Book, which uses ``MyST-Parser``, see"
" the official Jupyter Book tutorial: {doc}`jupyterbook:start/your-first-"
"book`"
msgstr ""
"若你是**从头新建项目而非迁移**，可参阅 {doc}`myst-parser:intro`。若你启动的是一个 **Jupyter 项目**，可以从使用"
" ``MyST-Parser`` 的 Jupyter Book 入手，参见官方 Jupyter Book "
"教程：{doc}`jupyterbook:start/your-first-book`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:20
msgid "How to write  your content both in reStructuredText and MyST"
msgstr "如何同时用 reStructuredText 和 MyST 编写内容"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:22
msgid ""
"It is useful to ask whether a migration is necessary in the first place. "
"Doing bulk migrations of large projects with lots of work in progress will "
"create conflicts for ongoing changes. On the other hand, your writers might "
"prefer to have some files in Markdown and some others in reStructuredText, "
"for whatever reason. Luckily, Sphinx supports reading both types of markup "
"at the same time without problems."
msgstr ""
"首先值得思考的是迁移是否真的必要。对有大量进行中工作的项目做批量迁移会与进行中的变更产生冲突。另一方面，你的作者出于各种原因可能更愿意一部分文件用 "
"Markdown、另一部分用 reStructuredText。幸运的是，Sphinx 支持同时读取两种标记语言，毫无问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:29
msgid ""
"To start using MyST in your existing Sphinx project, first [install the "
"`myst-parser` Python package](https://myst-"
"parser.readthedocs.io/en/stable/intro.html#installation) and then [enable it"
" on your configuration](https://myst-"
"parser.readthedocs.io/en/stable/intro.html#enable-myst-in-sphinx):"
msgstr ""
"要在现有 Sphinx 项目中使用 MyST，先 [安装 `myst-parser` Python 包](https://myst-"
"parser.readthedocs.io/en/stable/intro.html#installation)，然后 [在配置中启用它](https"
"://myst-parser.readthedocs.io/en/stable/intro.html#enable-myst-in-sphinx)："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:33
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:99
msgid "conf.py"
msgstr "conf.py"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:44
msgid ""
"Your reStructuredText documents will keep rendering, and you will be able to"
" add MyST documents with the `.md` extension that will be processed by MyST-"
"Parser."
msgstr "你的 reStructuredText 文档将继续正常渲染，并且可以添加 `.md` 扩展名的 MyST 文档，由 MyST-Parser 处理。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:48
msgid ""
"As an example, _this guide_ is written in MyST while the rest of the Read "
"the Docs documentation is written in reStructuredText."
msgstr "举例来说，_本指南_ 使用 MyST 编写，而 Read the Docs 其余文档使用 reStructuredText 编写。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:52
msgid ""
"By default, MyST-Parser registers the `.md` suffix for MyST source files. If"
" you want to use a different suffix, you can do so by changing your "
"`source_suffix` configuration value in `conf.py`."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，MyST-Parser 为 MyST 源文件注册 `.md` 后缀。若想使用其他后缀，可在 `conf.py` 中修改 "
"`source_suffix` 配置值。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:57
msgid "How to convert existing reStructuredText documentation to MyST"
msgstr "如何将现有 reStructuredText 文档转换为 MyST"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"To convert existing reST documents to MyST, you can use the `rst2myst` CLI "
"script shipped by {doc}`rst-to-myst:index`. The script supports converting "
"the documents one by one, or scanning a series of directories to convert "
"them in bulk."
msgstr ""
"要将现有 reST 文档转换为 MyST，可使用 {doc}`rst-to-myst:index` 提供的 `rst2myst` CLI "
"脚本。该脚本支持逐个转换文档，也可扫描一系列目录批量转换。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"After {doc}``installing `rst-to-myst` <rst-to-myst:index>``, you can run the"
" script as follows:"
msgstr "在 {doc}``安装 `rst-to-myst` <rst-to-myst:index>`` 之后，可按以下方式运行脚本："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:72
msgid "This will create a `.md` MyST file for every `.rst` source file converted."
msgstr "这会为每个已转换的 `.rst` 源文件创建一个 `.md` MyST 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:74
msgid "How to modify the behaviour of `rst2myst`"
msgstr "如何修改 `rst2myst` 的行为"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:76
msgid ""
"The `rst2myst` accepts several flags to modify its behavior. All of them "
"have sensible defaults, so you don't have to specify them unless you want "
"to."
msgstr "`rst2myst` 接受若干标志以修改其行为。它们都有合理的默认值，除非你确实需要，否则无需指定。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:80
msgid "These are a few options you might find useful:"
msgstr "以下是几个可能对你有用的选项："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:82
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{option}``-d, --dry-run <rst-to-myst:rst2myst-convert.--dry-run>``"
msgstr "{option}``-d, --dry-run <rst-to-myst:rst2myst-convert.--dry-run>``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:83
msgid ""
"Only verify that the script would work correctly, without actually writing "
"any files."
msgstr "仅验证脚本能否正确工作，不实际写入任何文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{option}``-R, --replace-files <rst-to-myst:rst2myst-convert.--replace-"
"files>``"
msgstr ""
"{option}``-R, --replace-files <rst-to-myst:rst2myst-convert.--replace-"
"files>``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:87
msgid ""
"Replace the `.rst` files by their `.md` equivalent, rather than writing a "
"new `.md` file next to the old `.rst` one."
msgstr "用对应的 `.md` 文件替换 `.rst` 文件，而不是在旧 `.rst` 文件旁写入新的 `.md` 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You can read the full list of options in {doc}``the `rst2myst` documentation"
" <rst-to-myst:cli>``."
msgstr "完整选项列表见 {doc}``the `rst2myst` documentation <rst-to-myst:cli>``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:93
msgid "How to enable optional syntax"
msgstr "如何启用可选语法"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:95
msgid ""
"Some reStructuredText syntax will require you to enable certain MyST "
"plugins. For example, to write [reST definition lists], you need to add a "
"`myst_enable_extensions` variable to your Sphinx configuration, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"部分 reStructuredText 语法需要你启用特定的 MyST 插件。例如，要编写 [reST 定义列表]，需在 Sphinx 配置中添加 "
"`myst_enable_extensions` 变量，如下所示："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You can learn more about {doc}`other MyST-Parser plugins <myst-"
"parser:syntax/optional>` in their documentation."
msgstr "关于 {doc}`其他 MyST-Parser 插件 <myst-parser:syntax/optional>` 的更多信息，请查阅其文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:111
msgid "How to write reStructuredText syntax within MyST"
msgstr "如何在 MyST 中编写 reStructuredText 语法"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:113
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"There is a small chance that `rst2myst` does not properly understand a piece"
" of reST syntax, either because there is a bug in the tool or because that "
"syntax does not have a MyST equivalent yet. For example, {ref}`as explained "
"in the documentation <myst-parser:howto/autodoc>`, the `sphinx.ext.autodoc` "
"extension is incompatible with MyST."
msgstr ""
"`rst2myst` 有很小概率无法正确理解某段 reST 语法——可能是工具的缺陷，也可能是该语法尚无 MyST 等价物。例如，{ref}`如文档所述"
" <myst-parser:howto/autodoc>`，`sphinx.ext.autodoc` 扩展与 MyST 不兼容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:119
msgid ""
"Fortunately, MyST supports an `eval-rst` directive that will parse the "
"content as reStructuredText, rather than MyST. For example:"
msgstr "幸运的是，MyST 支持 `eval-rst` 指令，它会将内容按 reStructuredText 而非 MyST 解析。例如："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:132
msgid "will produce the following result:"
msgstr "将产生以下结果："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:137
msgid "Complete MyST migration."
msgstr "完成 MyST 迁移。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/migrate-rest-myst.md:141
msgid ""
"As a result, this allows you to conduct a gradual migration, at the expense "
"of having heterogeneous syntax in your source files. In any case, the HTML "
"output will be the same."
msgstr "这让你可以进行渐进式迁移，代价是源文件中会存在混合语法。无论如何，HTML 输出完全相同。"

